#: omake:omake_99725F62_CFF6_4816_BE61_F39AD06CACFE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 18da2449257d45818244f70a2a7f31b8e1922edea7a1f8981e1d8117adb59491
