msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I wish I knew how all these uninvited souls kept finding their way to my mansion."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫おかしいわね、⟪k:3⟫また呼び寄せていない者が入り込んでいるわ。"

#: omake:omake_0FC36204_061C_4057_9C29_685A6FDCAD5A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 63754f769c81a116f7af99acff297aab4c8ca1d1ef0d4dc053813aae0f52186b
