msgid "⟪k:0⟫I’m not particularly attached to having long hair."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫別に長髪であることに意義は感じてない……。"

#: omake:omake_9972D410_BE8F_48F7_AC27_7AAC30A66518
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c395a627a8991c91bc06a542021fecb4ce7b03076232853cd6ea4658b3f56d33
